lassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"log_event\", \"event_name\", \"params\"), &GodotxFirebase::log_event);\nClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"is_ready\"), &GodotxFirebase::is_ready);\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/godot-x/firebase/blob/main/ios/firebase_bridge/Sources/godotx_firebase.mm#L17-L19\n\nIt only works if i drag/drop a recompiled `godot.xcframework` with `make build-godot`, but not the original template libraries from the engine.\n\nI search here for this problem, but i already set the flags to xcode project:\nhttps://github.com/godot-x/firebase/blob/main/ios/firebase_bridge/project.yml#L42-L63\n\nIm using 4.5.1 and generating the plugin also with 4.5.1.\n\nI dont know more what to do.\n\nCan someone help me to understand this problem?\n\nThanks.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nbrew install xcodegen\n\ngit clone https://github.com/godot-x/firebase.git\ncd firebase\n\nmake build-ios\nmake build-xcframework\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/godot-x/firebase/blob/main/project.godot","closed_by":{"login":"paulocoutinhox","id":395096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTA5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/395096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox","html_url":"https://github.com/paulocoutinhox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulocoutinhox/received_events","type":"User","user_view